[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708841847","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103841#issuecomment-2708841847","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103841","id":2708841847,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hdaV3","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T12:52:50Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T12:52:50Z","body":"The shortcuts aren't functional at runtime.\r\n\r\nAlso it would be nice to merge this with the code added in #98891, which does a similar thing.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708841847/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2709023308","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103841#issuecomment-2709023308","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103841","id":2709023308,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6heGpM","user":{"login":"GustJc","id":3084189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODQxODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3084189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc","html_url":"https://github.com/GustJc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T19:09:47Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T19:38:17Z","body":"> The shortcuts aren't functional at runtime.\r\n\r\nWhat exactly do you mean by they aren't function at runtime? \r\nDoesn't runtime mean while the game is running? If so, its working for me on Windows 10 as shown in the video.\r\n\r\nI don't think they are supposed to work **without the embed window**. But that could be a nice new feature addition. It just lacks a visual representation of the game being 'suspended', which is different from the editor 'pause' button.\r\nI've made a different PR a while ago to make old pause hotkey work on the focused game window without embedding. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103411\r\n\r\n> Also it would be nice to merge this with the code added in #98891, which does a similar thing.\r\n\r\nThey are already created in the same `_session_started` function. \r\nDo you mean send the hotkeys in the same message as the \"runtime_node_select_setup\" and use\r\nthat location to connect them to the input function instead?\r\nI think its better to separate the messages because they do different things. \r\nAnd its nice that the new message is near the other input connecting function.\r\n\r\nThe _handle_embed_keys is still necessary because of how the data is treated differently. \r\nReceiving a dict of shortcuts instead of a single one.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2709023308/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2709035388","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103841#issuecomment-2709035388","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103841","id":2709035388,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6heJl8","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T19:38:26Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T19:41:13Z","body":"> What exactly do you mean by they aren't function at runtime?\r\nDoesn't runtime mean while the game is running? If so, its working for me on Windows 10 as shown in the video.\r\n\r\nYeah, I missed that you need embedding enabled. I have 2 screens, so I don't run the game in embedded mode. I just expected the shortcut to work the same as F8.\r\n\r\n> The _handle_embed_keys is still necessary because of how the data is treated differently.\r\nReceiving a dict of shortcuts instead of a single one.\r\n\r\nThe stop shortcut could be included in the dict, so the 2 methods can be unified into 1.\r\nAlthough we could go further and pass a Callable with the shortcut, allowing for more or less universal registering of debug shortcuts at runtime. But that's out of scope for this PR,","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2709035388/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727378373","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103841#issuecomment-2727378373","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103841","id":2727378373,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ikH3F","user":{"login":"GustJc","id":3084189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODQxODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3084189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc","html_url":"https://github.com/GustJc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/e